RESEARCH USE ONLY. These labels are not a medical device. They have not been
validated for clinical decision-making, and they must not be used to guide the care
of a patient. Portions are pseudolabelled, portions carry a triaged rather than
exhaustive human review, and the limitations recorded in README.md are part of the
release.
